pcb-design is a Claude Code / Codex plugin of PCB design skills.

The skills (skills/**) are adapted from CLAUDE_PCB.md in GPiBridge,
https://github.com/gallicchio/GPiBridge (commit cf13e51, with later additions
from commit db68fe0), by Jason Gallicchio, who confirmed by email in 2026-11
that CLAUDE_PCB.md is MIT licensed. The adaptation (reorganised by topic into
skills, with edits and additions) and the plugin's tooling are by Wei Liu.

Everything in this repository is licensed under the MIT License below.

